<description>&lt;p&gt;Thailand is confronting a bomb explosion in its southern region that prompted police to tighten border security, while an explosion at an oil facility in Bangkok injured nine people. Cambodia lodged a formal protest over a Thai road expansion in Oddar Meanchey and both countries agreed to a UN-backed maritime site visit to address a disputed sea border. Thailand and Myanmar are pressing each other over arsenic contamination from Shan State mines, which is disrupting the Festival of Lights and driving joint monitoring efforts. A Japanese aid worker urged better integration of Myanmar migrants in Thailand. The UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOTGtxUEFnb0luRTIxQWdKN2wxZi1GU2RfMGY0ZElZZ0JvZWRrWE1BNzMtQ0tKR21LQVVXRXpwNV9TSlphTkFvZEwyT2U2dE5LT3hvYnVFeFRPNmZVT21xb2gtTnpGbktiZDhrVmZnNnEyT0VFVlczNXZHcHpwZGUySWtyZ1NkUVJUNmU2NzdTMkI3eTJ1czg5eDN4WUxfNFZSM0p3VnJjRXpqc3M1N1FLcXctaFo?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNcUpsRzU0UGYxVkZCSEoxZEswM1VjdHJqYWRtNFlIdHBUSy1XWVdXeXV6d3hFYktIR3Z0VGtPeW5YSkYwZDhoallmLUVnbjVBeW5jSnZwb2plU2tEQjNSX1hBbGxoc0FtVVotRVlubDR0YVNRTzUyMGRqWEFsMWNJT0RYXzRwNWxyWXpvdnVHeWpZU05oZWJfc0pUZEE2cU0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxOMDNxTXppRGtfUnZTaVFRU0xJYVdZT01jcGpUT1JaUFBzSklRekEtaURQRDFOMzZyUllyeThfeFZyUVdYZFk3ZjVYQndrVm1DcEhxUU5hSzd1eVJhYzMzQjFWdmZqalpDVkhUamljNU1NaDE5ZnVfRlE1NXo3V3dzaUxpRUdRdXVEWHVuanFFa2JUY0c4Ulc4?oc=5&quot;&gt;CamboJA News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQT0xDZ2R1eUVKTVcwUllPN29DamNTYmtvV1J0Wk9NS0JfX3ZNakN3RS1fSzBzb